msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Project-Id-Version: BlazBlue Calamity Trigger Ukrainian Translation\n"
"MIME-Version: 1.0\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\n"
"Language: uk\n"
"Plural-Forms: nplurals=3; plural=(n%10==1 && n%100!=11 ? 0 : n%10>=2 && n%10<=4 && (n%100<10 || n%100>=20) ? 1 : 2);\n"

#. Key: ArcEveNY01_00
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Arcade event: Nu
#. JA: 対象・認識・解析――不明・不明……
#. JA:   内部コードに不備を発見
msgctxt "ArcEveNY01_00"
msgid ""
"Target...identify...analyze...\n"
"Unknown...unknown...\n"
"A defect in the system code has occurred..."
msgstr ""
"Ціль. Ідентифікація. Аналіз... Невідомо. Невідомо...\n"
"Виявлено помилку у внутрішньому коді."

#. Key: ArcEveNY01_01
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Arcade event: Nu
#. JA: あなた……だれ？
msgctxt "ArcEveNY01_01"
msgid "Who...are you?"
msgstr "Ти... хто?"

#. Key: ArcEveNY01_02
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Speaker: Taokaka
#. Context: Arcade event: Nu
#. JA: ？タオはタオだぞ、ひらひらなオマエはひらひらか？
#. JA:   タオにニャんか用ニャスか？
msgctxt "ArcEveNY01_02"
msgid ""
"Tao is Tao. Are you flappy-flap?\n"
"What do you want from meow?"
msgstr ""
"Тао — це Тао. А ти, що вся тріпочеш, — Тріпотуха? Тобі\n"
"щось від Тао треба, няв?"

#. Key: ArcEveNY01_03
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Arcade event: Nu
#. JA: 状況・不明
#. JA:   回答・存在、ニュー
msgctxt "ArcEveNY01_03"
msgid ""
"Status: unknown.\n"
"Answer: existence, Nu."
msgstr "Стан: невідомо. Відповідь. Сутність: Ню."

#. Key: ArcEveNY01_04
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Speaker: Taokaka
#. Context: Arcade event: Nu
#. JA: ニャにいってるかわからニャいニャ。
#. JA:   でもタオと遊んでほしいなら相手にニャるッス！
#. JA:   シッシッ……
msgctxt "ArcEveNY01_04"
msgid ""
"I don't understand a word you're saying, meow.\n"
"But you wanna play with me!? I'm ready!\n"
"*whoosh* *whoosh*"
msgstr ""
"Нічого не розумію, няв. Але якщо хочеш погратися з Тао,\n"
"Тао складе тобі компанію! Шух-шух..."

#. Key: ArcEveNY01_05
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Arcade event: Nu
#. JA: 対象・戦闘・状況・対応
#. JA:   対象を敵対生物と判明……エラー
msgctxt "ArcEveNY01_05"
msgid ""
"Target...battle...status...response...\n"
"Target has been recognized as a hostile organism...\n"
"Error..."
msgstr ""
"Ціль. Бій. Стан. Реакція. Ціль визначено як вороже\n"
"створіння... Помилка."

#. Key: ArcEveNY01_06
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Arcade event: Nu
#. JA: 自律行動による適正対応を開始します。
msgctxt "ArcEveNY01_06"
msgid ""
"Appropriate action based on autonomous behavior has\n"
"been activated. "
msgstr "Розпочинаю належні дії в автономному режимі."

#. Key: ArcEveNY01_07
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Arcade event: Nu
#. JA: 対象の消滅を確認・不明・状況・不明……
msgctxt "ArcEveNY01_07"
msgid ""
"Elimination of the target has been confirmed.\n"
"Unknown... Status: unknown..."
msgstr "Зникнення цілі підтверджено. Невідомо. Стан: невідомо..."

#. Key: ArcEveNY02_00
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Arcade event: Nu
#. JA: あらお人形さん、お茶の香りに誘われて来たのかしら？
#. JA:   ギィ、来客よ。お茶の準備を。
msgctxt "ArcEveNY02_00"
msgid ""
"Were you lured here by the aroma of tea?\n"
"Gii, we have a guest. She will require a cup of tea."
msgstr ""
"О, лялечко, невже тебе сюди привів аромат чаю? Ґі, у нас\n"
"гостя. Приготуй чай."

#. Key: ArcEveNY02_01
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Arcade event: Nu
#. JA: 状況・不明・存在・不明
#. JA:   現状・重度の障害が発生していると認識
#. JA:   回復行動に移行――不可……
msgctxt "ArcEveNY02_01"
msgid ""
"Status: unknown... Existence: unknown...\n"
"Current condition: obstacle identified.\n"
"Shifting to recovery mode...failed..."
msgstr ""
"Стан: невідомо. Існування: невідомо. Поточний стан:\n"
"виявлено серйозний збій. Перехід до відновлення...\n"
"неможливо."

#. Key: ArcEveNY02_02
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Arcade event: Nu
#. JA: そう、これがあなたの望みなのね。
msgctxt "ArcEveNY02_02"
msgid "So, this is your wish..."
msgstr "Отже, це твоє бажання."

#. Key: ArcEveNY02_03
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Arcade event: Nu
#. JA: 自由な猫と戯れたり、青空の下を散歩する。
#. JA:   叶わぬ望みを持つ哀れな人形。
msgctxt "ArcEveNY02_03"
msgid ""
"...playing with a free-spirited cat and taking a walk under\n"
"the clear sky. A pathetic doll with dreams that will never\n"
"come true."
msgstr ""
"Бавитися з безтурботною кішкою й гуляти під блакитним\n"
"небом. Жалюгідна лялька, що плекає нездійсненне\n"
"бажання."

#. Key: ArcEveNY02_04
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Arcade event: Nu
#. JA: 状況・不明・不明……
msgctxt "ArcEveNY02_04"
msgid "Status: unknown...unknown..."
msgstr "Стан: невідомо. Невідомо..."

#. Key: ArcEveNY02_05
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Arcade event: Nu
#. JA: 不明？違うわ。それは不安よ。
msgctxt "ArcEveNY02_05"
msgid "Unknown? Oh dear me no. Try \"worry\"."
msgstr "Невідомо? Ні. Це тривога."

#. Key: ArcEveNY02_06
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Arcade event: Nu
#. JA: 返答・検索・「不安」
#. JA:   該当――無し……
msgctxt "ArcEveNY02_06"
msgid ""
"Response...search: \"worry\".\n"
"0 results returned..."
msgstr "Відповідь. Пошук: «тривога». Збігів немає..."

#. Key: ArcEveNY02_07
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Arcade event: Nu
#. JA: これは夢というものよ。
#. JA:   あなたの中に存在する願望の具現化。
msgctxt "ArcEveNY02_07"
msgid ""
"This is called a \"dream\": a manifestation of your deepest\n"
"desires."
msgstr ""
"Це називається сном. Втілення бажання, що живе\n"
"всередині тебе."

#. Key: ArcEveNY02_08
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Arcade event: Nu
#. JA: でもね、ここはあなたの迷い込んでいい夢ではないの。
msgctxt "ArcEveNY02_08"
msgid ""
"But I'm afraid this is not the sort of dream where you are\n"
"permitted to wander."
msgstr "Але це сон, у якому тобі не місце."

#. Key: ArcEveNY02_09
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Arcade event: Nu
#. JA: さあ、お人形さん。夢から覚めなさい。
msgctxt "ArcEveNY02_09"
msgid "It is time to wake up, little doll."
msgstr "Ну ж бо, лялечко. Прокинься."

#. Key: ArcEveNY02_10
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Arcade event: Nu
#. JA: さすがあなたの夢の中。でもね、これで終わり――
msgctxt "ArcEveNY02_10"
msgid "This was your dream, but now it has ended."
msgstr "Усе-таки це твій сон. Але на цьому все..."

#. Key: ArcEveNY03_00_0
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Arcade event: Nu
msgctxt "ArcEveNY03_00_0"
msgid "...Ragna..."
msgstr "...Раґно..."

#. Key: ArcEveNY03_00_1
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveNY_ArcEveNY05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveNY.pac)
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Arcade event: Nu
msgctxt "ArcEveNY03_00_1"
msgid "Where are you?"
msgstr "Де ти?"
